 "note": "What the farmer acts out after the player did something (scripts/actor.gd). The game has already changed the numbers; the farmer only catches up, and a new act interrupts the old one (it puts things down, gets up and walks to the new place). acts.<name>: steps in order — walk: 'target' (the place of the action) or a place name the game knows ('water' = the pond or well; 'spot:<id>'); face: the same; pose: a pose name and time (seconds to blend into it); loop: poses played in turn, times rounds, time per pose; hold: a prop into hand 'l' or 'r'; drop: hand; wait: seconds; sound: a sound name (data/sounds.json). poses.<name>: drop (lower the figure), lean (bend at the waist), head (look down), hip / knee (both legs; hip_l … for one; negative hip = leg forward, positive knee = shin back), sh: [forward (negative = arm forward/up), out] for both arms (sh_l / sh_r for one). props.<name>: parts made of simple shapes (box size [x,y,z], cyl [top, bottom, height], sphere [r], capsule [r, h]) placed in the hand (pos, rot in degrees).",
